{"ref":"powerup:armor-stat","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Armor_(stat).png","w":128,"h":128,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Armor is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. Each point of Armor the player has will reduce all incoming damage by 1 and increases the damage from retaliatory effects by 10%."]},{"k":"p","c":["The player has 0 base Armor before modifications, such as the characters bonuses or PowerUps. Armor is additional and the retaliatory damage bonus stack additively with itself and multiplicatively with ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["There is no upper limit to how much Armor the player can have, but the retaliatory bonus damage is capped at +500% (50 Armor). Also, regardless the amount of Armor the player has, the damage taken from an enemy will always be at least 1."]},{"k":"p","c":["Armor also affects Base Damage of ",{"i":"Sprite-Iron_Ball.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:iron-ball"}," ",{"t":"Iron Ball","r":"weapon:iron-ball"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Wrecking_Ball.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:wrecking-ball"}," ",{"t":"Wrecking Ball","r":"weapon:wrecking-ball"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Probotector.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:probotector"}," ",{"t":"Probotector","r":"character:probotector"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OperationGuns.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Operation Guns DLC to access"}," gains 10% Might per +1 Armor."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["ARMOR"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["3"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+1"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+3"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 600"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Armor PowerUp increases Armor by 1 per rank, with a maximum rank of 3. At rank 3, it provides +3 Armor. It initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 600."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Rank"],"h":1},{"c":["Armor"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+1"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["+2"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["+3"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-items","title":"From items","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Armor's associated passive item is ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:armor-item"}," ",{"t":"Armor (item)","r":"passive:armor-item"},", which increases Armor by 1 per level, up to a maximum of +5 Armor at level 5."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Centralis_Custos.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:centralis-custos"}," ",{"t":"Centralis Custos","r":"weapon:centralis-custos"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," provides +10 Armor when the player character takes damage from enemies."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Trinum_Custodem.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:trinum-custodem"}," ",{"t":"Trinum Custodem","r":"weapon:trinum-custodem"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," provides a passive +10 Armor and an additional +10 Armor when the player character takes damage from enemies."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Paranormal_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"t":"Paranormal Scan","r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"}," has a chance of granting an Armor stat bonus of +0.2 upon activation."]},{"c":[{"i":"Spr