mor now also increases retaliatory damage by 10%. Retaliatory damage is currently inflicted by NO FUTURE and Arcana XIX"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 27 October 2021 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The Armor sprite had an old design. It is likely inspired from the ",{"t":"Iron Plate","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Plate"}," from the ",{"t":"Castlevania series","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/castlevania"},"."]},{"c":["Armor uses its UK spelling, \"Armour\", in the descriptions of ",{"i":"Sprite-Stanley.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:stanley"}," ",{"t":"Stanley","r":"character:stanley"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Probotector.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:probotector"}," ",{"t":"Probotector","r":"character:probotector"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Ariana.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:ariana"}," ",{"t":"Ariana","r":"character:ariana"},", even though the American spelling is otherwise used in the game."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}